# --- @fill: locative prepositions with rooms/furniture ------------------------
# The centrepiece: am/an der/op dem/ënner dem/niewent dem — room and furniture
# frames specific to this lesson's vocabulary. A1_08 drills the same prepositions
# with generic places; these use home/furniture nouns so the two don't overlap.
# Distractors are other locative preps from the same set.

@fill
@lu De Frigo steet [an der] Kichen.
@en The fridge is [in the] kitchen.
@distractor-lu am
@distractor-lu op der
@distractor-lu niewent der
@distractor-en at the
@distractor-en on the
@distractor-en next to the

@fill
@lu De Canapé steet [am] Living.
@en The couch is [in the] living room.
@distractor-lu an der
@distractor-lu op dem
@distractor-lu ënner dem
@distractor-en on the
@distractor-en under the
@distractor-en next to the

@fill
@lu D'Wäschmaschinn ass [an der] Garage.
@en The washing machine is [in the] garage.
@distractor-lu am
@distractor-lu op der
@distractor-lu ënner der
@distractor-en at the
@distractor-en on the
@distractor-en under the

