# --- @fill: negation kee/keng for rooms ---------------------------------------
# The deck's fill-in exercise drills "keen Iesszëmmer / kee Keller / keng Terrass".
# kee = masculine before consonant, keen = masculine before vowel, keng = feminine/
# plural. Distractors swap the gender form so the learner must match the noun.

@fill
@lu Dat Haus huet [kee] Keller.
@en That house has [no] cellar.
@distractor-lu keng
@distractor-lu keen
@distractor-lu eng
@distractor-en a
@distractor-en the
@distractor-en some

@fill
@lu D'Appartement huet [keen] Iesszëmmer.
@en The flat has [no] dining room.
@distractor-lu keng
@distractor-lu kee
@distractor-lu eng
@distractor-en a
@distractor-en the
@distractor-en some

@fill
@lu D'Wunneng huet [keng] Terrass.
@en The home has [no] terrace.
@distractor-lu kee
@distractor-lu keen
@distractor-lu eng
@distractor-en a
@distractor-en the
@distractor-en some

@fill
@lu Dat Haus huet [keng] Piscine.
@en That house has [no] swimming pool.
@distractor-lu kee
@distractor-lu keen
@distractor-lu eng
@distractor-en a
@distractor-en the
@distractor-en some

# --- @fill: separable verbs opmaachen/zoumaachen -----------------------------
# Both are taught as @word in this lesson. The prefix goes to the end in a main
# clause. Distractors swap the two prefixes so the learner picks open vs close.

@fill
@lu Maach d'Fënster [op], et ass waarm!
@en [Open] the window, it is warm!
@distractor-lu zou
@distractor-lu aus
@distractor-lu un
@distractor-en Close
@distractor-en Turn off
@distractor-en Turn on

@fill
@lu Maach d'Dier [zou], et ass kal!
@en [Close] the door, it is cold!
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu aus
@distractor-lu un
@distractor-en Open
@distractor-en Turn off
@distractor-en Turn on

@fill
@lu Ech maache moies d'Fënsteren am Schlofzëmmer [op].
@en In the morning I [open] the windows in the bedroom.
@distractor-lu zou
@distractor-lu aus
@distractor-lu un
@distractor-en close
@distractor-en turn off
@distractor-en turn on

@fill
@lu Owes maache mir d'Garage [zou].
@en In the evening we [close] the garage.
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu aus
@distractor-lu un
@distractor-en open
@distractor-en turn off
@distractor-en turn on
